<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Serie A 2026/27 · 5ª Giornata — Report analitico e pronostici</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#070b14; --bg2:#0c1322; --card:#101a2e; --card2:#142139;
  --line:#1f2f4d; --txt:#e8eefc; --dim:#93a4c4; --dim2:#6d7f9f;
  --green:#22e3a4; --green2:#0f9e74; --blue:#5b8cff; --yellow:#ffd166;
  --red:#ff5d73; --purple:#a78bfa; --orange:#ff9f45;
  --grad:linear-gradient(135deg,#22e3a4 0%,#5b8cff 55%,#a78bfa 100%);
  --shadow:0 18px 50px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.85);
  --r:18px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  margin:0;background:
    radial-gradient(1100px 600px at 12% -8%, rgba(34,227,164,.14), transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(900px 520px at 88% 0%, rgba(91,140,255,.16), transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(700px 700px at 50% 120%, rgba(167,139,250,.10), transparent 60%),
    var(--bg);
  color:var(--txt); font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  line-height:1.55; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}
a{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none}
.wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px 90px}

/* ---------- HERO ---------- */
header.hero{position:relative;padding:46px 0 26px;overflow:hidden}
.hero-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);border:1px solid rgba(34,227,164,.35);
  background:rgba(34,227,164,.08);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700}
.dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(34,227,164,.7);animation:pulse 2.2s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 9px rgba(34,227,164,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(34,227,164,0)}}
h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,56px);line-height:1.05;margin:16px 0 10px;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-weight:800}
h1 .grad{background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.sub{color:var(--dim);font-size:16.5px;max-width:820px}
.hero-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:20px}
.chip{background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:7px 13px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;color:var(--dim)}
.chip b{color:var(--txt)}

/* ---------- NAV ---------- */
nav.sticky{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  background:rgba(7,11,20,.82);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:26px}
nav.sticky .inner{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:10px 20px;display:flex;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;align-items:center}
nav.sticky a{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--dim);padding:7px 12px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;border:1px solid transparent}
nav.sticky a:hover{color:var(--txt);background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border-color:var(--line)}
.nav-actions{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px}
.btn{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--txt);
  padding:8px 13px;border-radius:11px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;transition:.18s;font-family:inherit}
.btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn.acc{background:var(--grad);color:#04121a;border:none}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent}

/* ---------- SECTIONS ---------- */
section{margin:52px 0;scroll-margin-top:74px}
.s-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:20px}
.s-head h2{font-size:clamp(21px,2.6vw,30px);margin:0;letter-spacing:-.01em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}
.s-head h2 .num{font-size:13px;color:var(--green);border:1px solid rgba(34,227,164,.35);border-radius:8px;padding:2px 8px;font-weight:800}
.s-head p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--dim);font-size:14px;max-width:760px}

/* ---------- KPI ---------- */
.kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:14px}
.kpi{background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(255,255,255,.055),rgba(255,255,255,.015));
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:17px 18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.kpi:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0 0 auto 0;height:2px;background:var(--grad);opacity:.85}
.kpi .lbl{font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim2);font-weight:700}
.kpi .val{font-size:29px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:6px}
.kpi .sub2{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:3px}

/* ---------- CARDS ---------- */
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(330px,1fr));gap:16px}
.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px}

/* ---------- TABLE ---------- */
.tbl-wrap{overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);background:var(--card)}
table{border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;width:100%;font-size:13.5px;min-width:820px}
th,td{padding:10px 12px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05)}
th{background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);color:var(--dim);font-size:11.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2;white-space:nowrap}
th:hover{color:var(--txt)}
th.sorted:after{content:' ▼';color:var(--green);font-size:10px}
th.sorted.asc:after{content:' ▲'}
td.team{text-align:left;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
tr:hover td{background:rgba(91,140,255,.06)}
.pill{display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:7px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700}
.pill.pos{background:rgba(34,227,164,.14);color:var(--green)}
.pill.eu{background:rgba(91,140,255,.16);color:#9dbaff}
.pill.releg{background:rgba(255,93,115,.14);color:#ff9aa8}
.form{display:inline-flex;gap:3px}
.form i{width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:5px;font-style:normal;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.f-V{background:rgba(34,227,164,.2);color:var(--green)}
.f-N{background:rgba(255,209,102,.18);color:var(--yellow)}
.f-P{background:rgba(255,93,115,.18);color:var(--red)}
.bar{height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);overflow:hidden;min-width:52px}
.bar>span{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:var(--grad)}

/* ---------- MATCH CARDS ---------- */
.filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}
.fbtn{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:var(--dim);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:inherit;transition:.18s}
.fbtn:hover{color:var(--txt);border-color:#2c4066}
.fbtn.on{background:var(--grad);color:#04121a;border-color:transparent}
.mcards{display:grid;gap:14px}
.mcard{background:linear-gradient(165deg,var(--card2),var(--card));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;transition:.2s}
.mcard:hover{border-color:#2b4067;transform:translateY(-2px)}
.mcard .top{padding:16px 18px;cursor:pointer}
.mcard .row1{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.daytag{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(91,140,255,.15);color:#a9c2ff}
.status{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px}
.st-upcoming{background:rgba(34,227,164,.14);color:var(--green)}
.st-live{background:rgba(255,93,115,.16);color:#ff9aa8}
.st-played{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:var(--dim)}
.teams-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-top:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tname{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.scorebox{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--green);background:rgba(34,227,164,.1);border:1px solid rgba(34,227,164,.3);padding:3px 12px;border-radius:10px}
.vs{color:var(--dim2);font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
.mt-meta{color:var(--dim);font-size:13px;margin-left:auto;text-align:right}
.stars{letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--yellow);font-size:13px}
.probs3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:14px}
.pbox{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px}
.pbox .lbl{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim2);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
.pbox .big{font-size:20px;font-weight:800}
.pbox .mini{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--dim)}
.pbar{height:7px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:7px}
.pbar>span{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#22e3a4,#5b8cff);border-radius:99px;transition:width .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
.pbar.mkt>span{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#3b4c6b,#54688c)}
.details{padding:0 18px 18px;display:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
.mcard.open .details{display:block;animation:fade .3s ease}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.dgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(270px,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:16px}
.block h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--green)}
.block p,.block li{font-size:13.5px;color:#c6d2ea;margin:5px 0}
.block ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}
.mini-tbl{width:100%;font-size:12.5px;min-width:0}
.mini-tbl td{padding:5px 7px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05)}
.mini-tbl td:last-child{text-align:right;font-weight:700}
.ev-pos{color:var(--green)}.ev-neg{color:var(--red)}.ev-neu{color:var(--yellow)}
.taglist{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}
.tg{font-size:11.5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:7px;background:rgba(255,93,115,.12);color:#ffb0bb;border:1px solid rgba(255,93,115,.22)}
.heat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:3px;max-width:300px}
.heat div{aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:5px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10.5px;color:#04121a;font-weight:700;cursor:help}
.heat-hdr{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim2);margin-bottom:6px}

/* ---------- SIMULATOR ---------- */
.slip{position:relative}
.sim-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
.sim-row .nm{min-width:210px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}
.selbtn{cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);color:var(--dim)}
.selbtn:hover{border-color:#31486f;color:var(--txt)}
.selbtn.on{background:var(--grad);color:#04121a;border-color:transparent}
.selbtn .q{opacity:.8;font-weight:600;margin-left:5px}
.summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:16px}
.sumbox{background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:13px}
.sumbox .lbl{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:700}
.sumbox .v{font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin-top:3px}
input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:#22e3a4}
input[type=number]{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--txt);border-radius:9px;padding:7px 10px;font-family:inherit;width:130px}

/* ---------- SCHEDINE ---------- */
.sched{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:16px}
.scard{background:linear-gradient(165deg,rgba(255,255,255,.06),rgba(255,255,255,.01));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.scard h3{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:17px}
.scard .tg2{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--green);font-weight:800}
.scard ul{list-style:none;margin:12px 0;padding:0}
.scard li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-size:13.5px;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.scard .foot{margin-top:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.scard .foot div{background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:9px}
.scard .foot .lbl{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--dim2);text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.07em}
.scard .foot .v{font-size:17px;font-weight:800}
.note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:10px}
.warn{background:rgba(255,209,102,.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,209,102,.28);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#ffe6ad}

/* ---------- CHARTS ---------- */
svg{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
.legend{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:10px}
.legend i{display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:6px}

/* ---------- MISC ---------- */
.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:16px}
@media(max-width:900px){.split{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.method li{margin:7px 0;font-size:14px;color:#c6d2ea}
.method b{color:var(--txt)}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:60px;padding:26px 0;color:var(--dim2);font-size:12.5px}
.small{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--dim)}
.kbd{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px}
details.src{margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--dim)}
details.src summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--blue)}
@media print{nav.sticky,.nav-actions{display:none}.details{display:block!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header class="hero">
  <span class="hero-badge"><span class="dot"></span>Report generato il 19 settembre 2026 · ore 16:30 CEST</span>
  <h1>Serie A 2026/27 — <span class="grad">5ª Giornata</span><br>Analisi, probabilità e schede scommessa</h1>
  <p class="sub">Dati, statistiche e modelli su tutte le 10 partite del turno: forma, xG, precedenti, indisponibili, quote reali,
  modello Poisson bivariato (Dixon-Coles) ancorato al mercato, value bet, gestione del bankroll e quattro schede pronte da giocare
  (o da evitare).</p>
  <div class="hero-meta" id="heroMeta"></div>
</header>

<nav class="sticky">
  <div class="inner">
    <a href="#sintesi">Sintesi</a>
    <a href="#metodo">Metodo</a>
    <a href="#classifica">Classifica</a>
    <a href="#partite">Partite</a>
    <a href="#simulatore">Simulatore schedina</a>
    <a href="#schedine">Schede pronte</a>
    <a href="#value">Value &amp; Avoid</a>
    <a href="#grafici">Grafici</a>
    <a href="#fonti">Fonti</a>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <button class="btn ghost" onclick="toggleAll()">Apri/chiudi tutte</button>
      <button class="btn acc" onclick="window.print()">Stampa / PDF</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ============ SINTESI ============ -->
<section id="sintesi">
  <div class="s-head">
    <div><h2><span class="num">01</span> Sintesi della giornata</h2>
    <p>Le 10 gare del quinto turno, il contesto di classifica e le indicazioni principali emerse dal modello.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpis" id="kpis"></div>
  <div class="grid2" style="margin-top:16px">
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:17px">Il quadro del turno</h3>
      <ul class="method" id="sintesiList"></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:17px">La giocata del turno</h3>
      <div id="topPick"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
    <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:17px">Scenari di vetta (effetto della 5ª giornata sulla classifica)</h3>
    <div id="scenari"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="warn" style="margin-top:16px">
    <b>Nota di trasparenza.</b> Le probabilità pubblicate in questo report sono stime e non previsioni certe: il calcio è un sistema
    a bassa predicibilità. Tutti i confronti con le quote sono fatti su quote reali raccolte il 18-19 settembre 2026 e sono riportati
    a fini informativi/statistici. Il margine del banco (5-8% per mercato) rende la maggior parte delle giocate a valore atteso
    negativo: le schede sono costruite per ridurne l'impatto, non per eliminarlo.
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ METODO ============ -->
<section id="metodo">
  <div class="s-head">
    <div><h2><span class="num">02</span> Come nasce questo report</h2>
    <p>Il modello in quattro passaggi, senza scatole nere: ogni numero è ricalcolabile.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="split">
    <div class="card">
      <ol class="method">
        <li><b>Forza offensiva e difensiva.</b> Per ogni squadra calcolo gol fatti/subiti per partita rispetto alla media del
        campionato (1,51 gol per squadra) e applico uno <i>shrinkage</i> del 40%: con sole 4 giornate i dati individuali sono
        rumorosi, quindi li avvicino alla media di lega.</li>
        <li><b>Gol attesi (λ).</b> Combino il modello attacco/difesa (con fattore campo +10% in casa) con gli xG previsti dalle fonti
        esterne, peso 35%/65%, e applico correzioni qualitative documentate: infortuni pesanti, squalifiche, fatica europea.</li>
        <li><b>Poisson bivariato (Dixon-Coles).</b> Dalla coppia di gol attesi genero la matrice di tutti i risultati (0-0 … 10-10)
        con correzione per i punteggi bassi (ρ = −0,06). Da qui escono 1X2, GG/NG, Over/Under e i risultati esatti.</li>
        <li><b>Ancoraggio al mercato.</b> Converto le quote reali in probabilità con il <i>power method</i> (rimozione del margine) e
        fondo il 70% mercato + 30% modello, imponendo che nessun esito possa divergere dal mercato per più di <b>4 punti
        percentuali</b>. È il vincolo che evita "value bet" illusorie: le nostre probabilità restano prudenti.</li>
      </ol>
      <details class="src">
        <summary>Dettagli tecnici (clicca per aprire)</summary>
        <p class="small">Poisson: P(k) = e<sup>−λ</sup>λ<sup>k</sup>/k!. Correzione Dixon-Coles: τ(0,0)=1−λμρ, τ(0,1)=1+λρ,
        τ(1,0)=1+μρ, τ(1,1)=1−ρ. Rimozione margine: p<sub>i</sub> ∝ o<sub>i</sub><sup>k</sup> con k tale che Σp<sub>i</sub>=1.
        Value atteso: EV = p·quota − 1. Stake: Kelly frazionato f* = ¼·(p·q−1)/(q−1).</p>
      </details>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:17px">Cosa guarda il modello</h3>
      <table class="mini-tbl" id="methodTbl"></table>
      <div class="note">Le probabilità finali pubblicate nelle schede partita sono quelle ancorate al mercato.
      I dati di forma, xG e indisponibili provengono dalle fonti elencate in fondo al report.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CLASSIFICA ============ -->
<section id="classifica">
  <div class="s-head">
    <div><h2><span class="num">03</span> Classifica dopo 4 giornate</h2>
    <p>Clicca sulle intestazioni per ordinare. Le squadre impegnate nella 5ª giornata sono evidenziate.</p></div>
    <div class="filters">
      <input type="text" id="q" placeholder="Filtra squadra…" style="width:200px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--txt);border-radius:9px;padding:7px 10px;font-family:inherit">
      <label class="small"><input type="checkbox" id="onlyField" checked> solo squadre in campo</label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tbl-wrap"><table id="cls"><thead></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
  <p class="small" style="margin-top:10px">Legenda: <span class="pill pos">1-4</span> Champions League ·
  <span class="pill eu">5-6</span> Europa/Conference · <span class="pill releg">17-20</span> zona retrocessione.
  Cagliari a 9 punti con la miglior difesa su azione del torneo (1 gol su azione subito).</p>
</section>

<!-- ============ PARTITE ============ -->
<section id="partite">
  <div class="s-head">
    <div><h2><span class="num">04</span> Le 10 partite, una per una</h2>
    <p>Probabilità (modello ancorato al mercato), quote reali, gol attesi, precedenti, indisponibili e giocata consigliata.
    Clicca su una partita per aprire l'analisi completa.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="tbl-wrap" style="margin-bottom:18px">
    <table id="overview"><thead></thead><tbody></tbody></table>
  </div>
